<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Explore FLOW / JobFlow, an AI-powered candidate and employer recruitment platform created and led by Diana Radchenko.">
<title>JobFlow | Project Showcase</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--navy:#05283b;--ink:#153245;--muted:#516876;--mint:#d7f5eb;--line:#dae5eb;--bg:#f4f8fa}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}a{color:inherit}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #16a69d;outline-offset:3px}.shell{max-width:1060px;margin:auto;padding:0 22px}.hero{background:var(--navy);color:white;padding:28px 0 70px}.bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:60px}.brand{font-weight:800;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.02em}.kicker{text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#b7d5df;font-weight:700}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:7px 13px;border-radius:30px;background:#ddf7ee;color:#155e53;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,67px);max-width:840px;line-height:1.07;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:18px 0 20px}.hero p{max-width:760px;color:#cfe1e9;font-size:18px}.buttons{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}.button{border:1px solid #aec8d1;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:12px 18px;display:inline-block;cursor:pointer;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit}.button.primary{background:#c9f5e5;color:#073629;border-color:#c9f5e5}.button:hover{filter:brightness(.94)}main{margin-top:-28px;position:relative}.panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(16,48,67,.04)}h2{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 15px}h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:19px}p{margin:7px 0 12px}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.mini{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px}.pill{background:#edf5fa;border-radius:30px;padding:5px 10px;color:#225677;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.steps{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.steps span{padding:9px 13px;background:#eff7f8;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.credentials{background:#f4f8fa;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin:14px 0}.credrow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin:6px 0}.credval{overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px}.copy{border:1px solid #b8d0da;background:white;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 9px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.resource{display:block;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:20px;height:100%}.resource:hover{border-color:#248b87;background:#f5fcfa}.weights{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:12px 0}.weights span{padding:7px 11px;background:var(--mint);color:#185f55;border-radius:9px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.notice{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}footer{color:#607887;text-align:center;padding:25px}.sub{font-size:15px} @media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.bar{margin-bottom:36px}.hero{padding-bottom:62px}.hero p{font-size:16px}.panel{padding:21px}.hero h1{font-size:40px}} 
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero"><div class="shell">
  <div class="bar"><div class="brand">◇ FLOW / JobFlow</div><span class="kicker">Project Showcase</span></div>
  <span class="tag">LIVE STUDENT SOFTWARE PROJECT · 2026–PRESENT</span>
  <h1>One Connected Recruitment Ecosystem</h1>
  <p>An AI-powered career and recruitment platform connecting resumes, job matching, applications, messaging, and interviews across candidate and employer workflows.</p>
  <p class="sub">Created and led by <strong>Diana Radchenko</strong></p>
  <div class="buttons"><a class="button primary" href="https://moveupcareer.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the live platform ↗</a><a class="button" href="https://github.com/diana-radchenko/JobFlow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View source code ↗</a></div>
</div></header>
<main class="shell">
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="workflow"><h2 id="workflow">How the connected platform works</h2>
 <div class="grid"><div class="mini"><span class="pill">JOBFLOW · CANDIDATE</span><h3>From resume to interview</h3><p class="muted">Create tailored resumes, explore matching vacancies, apply, track statuses, communicate, and practice interviews.</p></div>
 <div class="mini"><span class="pill">HRFLOW · EMPLOYER</span><h3>From vacancy to candidate</h3><p class="muted">Publish openings, review applications, update statuses, communicate, and schedule interviews.</p></div></div>
 <p class="muted">Candidate and employer actions use shared recruitment records.</p>
 <div class="steps"><span>Resume</span><span>Job Match</span><span>Apply</span><span>Track</span><span>Chat</span><span>Interview</span></div>
</section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="matching"><h2 id="matching">Job Match — explainable, not a black box</h2>
 <p>Job Match compares a candidate's primary resume with a vacancy using rule-based scoring. The “Why this matches” view breaks down the result and surfaces strengths and missing skills. Relevant projects, volunteering, and leadership can contribute to experience; unspecified education requirements are not penalized.</p>
 <div class="weights"><span>Skills 45%</span><span>Role relevance 30%</span><span>Experience 15%</span><span>Education 10%</span></div>
 <p class="notice">The match score describes resume–vacancy fit, not the probability of being hired.</p>
</section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="access"><h2 id="access">Try the platform</h2>
 <p class="muted">These credentials are for dedicated test accounts only. No sign-up is needed. Please do not enter real personal information.</p>
 <div class="grid">
 @foreach ([
   ['title'=>'Candidate access — JobFlow','description'=>'Resumes · Matching · Applications · Interview practice','email'=>config('showcase.candidate_email'),'password'=>config('showcase.candidate_password'),'url'=>url('/jobflow')],
   ['title'=>'Employer access — HRFlow','description'=>'Vacancies · Applicants · Interviews · Messaging','email'=>config('showcase.employer_email'),'password'=>config('showcase.employer_password'),'url'=>url('/hrflow')]
 ] as $account)
 <div class="mini"><h3>{{ $account['title'] }}</h3><p class="muted sub">{{ $account['description'] }}</p>
 @if($account['email'] && $account['password'])
 <div class="credentials"><div class="credrow"><div><strong>Email</strong><div class="credval">{{ $account['email'] }}</div></div><button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="{{ $account['email'] }}" aria-label="Copy email">Copy</button></div>
 <div class="credrow"><div><strong>Password</strong><div class="credval" data-secret>••••••••••••</div></div><div><button class="copy" type="button" data-reveal="{{ $account['password'] }}" aria-label="Reveal password">Show</button> <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="{{ $account['password'] }}" aria-label="Copy password">Copy</button></div></div></div>
 @else
 <p class="notice">Demo credentials will be available once configured by the site administrator.</p>
 @endif
 <a class="button primary" href="{{ $account['url'] }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open {{ str_contains($account['title'], 'Candidate') ? 'JobFlow' : 'HRFlow' }} ↗</a>
 </div>
 @endforeach
 </div>
</section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="contribution"><h2 id="contribution">My personal contribution</h2>
 <p>I conceived FLOW, defined the product requirements, user journeys, and priorities, and guided the initial implementation with a collaborating developer. I later worked directly in the codebase to debug, test, and improve the platform, especially the explainable Job Match algorithm and connected recruitment workflows.</p>
 <p class="muted sub">Technologies: Laravel · PHP · Vue · TypeScript · Inertia.js · Docker</p>
</section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="resources"><h2 id="resources">Watch, read, and verify</h2><div class="grid">
 @if(config('showcase.video_url'))
 <a class="resource" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ config('showcase.video_url') }}"><h3>▶ Video walkthrough ↗</h3><p class="muted">See the candidate and employer workflows in action.</p></a>
 @else <div class="resource"><h3>▶ Video walkthrough</h3><p class="muted">Coming soon.</p></div> @endif
 @if(config('showcase.presentation_url'))
 <a class="resource" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ config('showcase.presentation_url') }}"><h3>▤ Project presentation ↗</h3><p class="muted">Screenshots, architecture, and product features.</p></a>
 @else <div class="resource"><h3>▤ Project presentation</h3><p class="muted">Coming soon.</p></div> @endif
 <a class="resource" href="https://github.com/diana-radchenko/JobFlow" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><h3>⌘ GitHub repository ↗</h3><p class="muted">Public source code, implementation, and documentation.</p></a>
 <a class="resource" href="https://moveupcareer.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><h3>↗ Live website</h3><p class="muted">Explore the current working product.</p></a>
 </div></section>
</main>
<footer>FLOW / JobFlow · Project Showcase · Diana Radchenko</footer>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(button.dataset.copy);button.textContent='Copied';setTimeout(()=>button.textContent='Copy',1400)}catch{button.textContent='Select text'}}));
document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{let text=button.closest('.credrow').querySelector('[data-secret]');let visible=button.textContent==='Hide';text.textContent=visible?'••••••••••••':button.dataset.reveal;button.textContent=visible?'Show':'Hide'}));
</script>
</body></html>